B.X5=new A.uF("AIPPM","All India Political Parties Meet","The AIPPM recreates the high-stakes floor of Indian politics, where representatives of national and regional parties come together to debate matters of urgent national concern. Delegates will need to balance party ideology, coalition politics, public sentiment, and national interest as they work toward \u2014 or resist \u2014 consensus.","Deliberation on India's National Security Strategy following a major cross-border terror attack.")
